            "content": "Defining a Generic Container:",
            "code": "public class Vault<T> {\n    private T item;\n    \n    public void store(T item) {\n        this.item = item;\n    }\n    \n    public T retrieve() {\n        return this.item;\n    }\n}\n\n// Usage:\nVault<String> textVault = new Vault<>();\ntextVault.store(\"Soul Flame\");\nString value = textVault.retrieve(); // No manual cast required!"
