          "starterCode": "// Guided Project: Atomic Treasury Transfer\n// Test in your local IDE with your database connection!\nimport java.sql.Connection;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        System.out.println(\"Treasury transaction template ready.\");\n    }\n}",
